<title>USA: SPX completes Hy-Lift division sale.</title>
<headline>SPX completes Hy-Lift division sale.</headline>
<dateline>MUSKEGON, Mich. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>SPX Corp said Friday it completed the sale of its Hy-Lift division to W.A. Thomas of Taylor, Mich.</p>
<p>Hy-Lift manufactures valve train components for internal combustion engines.</p>
<p>SPX designs and manufactures specialty service tools and original equipment components for the motor vehicle industry.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
